n    (∀ᶠ (C : Real) in Filter.atTop.{0},\n      ∀ ⦃x : α⦄, Membership.mem.{u, u} s x → ∀ ⦃y : α⦄, Membership.mem.{u, u} s y → LE.le.{0} (Dist.dist.{u} x y) C)","unsafe":false,"value":281,"source":{"code":"theorem isBounded_iff_eventually {s : Set α} :\n    IsBounded s ↔ ∀ᶠ C in atTop, ∀ ⦃x⦄, x ∈ s → ∀ ⦃y⦄, y ∈ s → dist x y ≤ C :=\n  isBounded_iff.trans\n    ⟨fun ⟨C, h⟩ => eventually_atTop.2 ⟨C, fun _C' hC' _x hx _y hy => (h hx hy).trans hC'⟩,\n      Eventually.exists⟩","start":605,"end":609},"axioms":["Classical.choice","Quot.sound","propext"]}